`kernel/patches/` are derived from the Linux kernel and are licensed
**GPL-2.0**, matching the files they derive from. Original copyright remains
with their respective authors; see the SPDX headers in each file.

`userspace/tiny-dfr-t1-digitizer-name.patch` is a patch against
[tiny-dfr](https://github.com/WhatAmISupposedToPutHere/tiny-dfr), which is MIT
licensed; the patch is offered under the same terms.

